# Brownfield Review: MCP ergonomics baseline evaluation

Gate: Brownfield Review
Type: Brownfield Review
Mode: `post_ur_review`
Status: `done`

## Run

- run_id: mcp-ergonomics-baseline-20261016-01
- related_ur: .agdf/control/artefacts/mcp-ergonomics-baseline-20261016-01/UR.md (approved, revision 04185eed-28c9-4f21-86de-0a3b2bbf0870)
