## PRD / SD Open Questions

| Question | Required gate | Impact |
|---|---|---|
| Exact metric definitions and counting rules, including AGDF failure outcomes while `isError` is unset and token estimation method | `PRD` | `revise` |
| Task set: which representative AGDF tasks, expected outcomes, and how many repetitions per host/variant within a cost budget | `PRD` | `revise` |
| Which hosts/models/platforms: Codex CLI is not installed on this Windows machine and `codex-host-e2e.mjs` documents macOS/Linux usage; Claude Code 2.1.268 is available here | `PRD` | `revise` |
| How the MCP-only variant loads the AGDF MCP server without skills/hooks on each host, using only host configuration (no product change) | `SD` | `revise` |
| Reliable per-host source for tokens/cost and for whether `isError`/structured content reach the model | `SD` | `warn` |
| Tracked location and format of baseline data and report (outside gitignored `probe-results/`); whether new files enter any recorded compatibility source set | `SD` | `warn` |
| Shared extraction versus import of native-probe parsing/redaction | `SD` | `warn` |

